      "A side feature with unknown reward coefficient remains inside the reward-scale gauge.",
      "An externally calibrated full-range additive consequence localizes each registered occupancy functional.",
      "After localization, reward is identified modulo exactly the declared linear gauge if and only if the occupancy matrix kernel equals that gauge.",
      "The smallest quotient singular value controls Euclidean reconstruction stability."
