      "Every policy or environment exposes a known linear occupancy functional.",
      "The result supersedes general inverse-reinforcement-learning identifiability or environment-design theory.",
      "Classical inverse-problem, numeraire, bisection, reward-invariance, or experimental-design mathematics is new.",
